<title>LEBANON: Lebanon sells bank to Saudi sheikh.</title>
<headline>Lebanon sells bank to Saudi sheikh.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's central bank announced on Thursday the sale of its 97 percent holding in medium-size Credit Libanais bank to Saudi Sheikh Khalid bin Mahfouz.</p>
</text>
